            "detailed_description": "<h1>Características</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Physics Platforming</strong>: Bounce, slide, and ping your way through unpredictable, abstract environments.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Melting Visuals &amp; Sound</strong>: A bright, high-contrast palette paired with a nostalgic, lo-fi soundscape that hits all the right retro frequencies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Narrative (Sort Of)</strong>: Unravel the mystery of what Susan actually wants from you. Susan is just here to help! …isn’t she?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Levels</strong>: With an easy-to-use level creator, you can craft your own cheap golf holes (if you ask Susan nicely).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Replayability</strong>: Hundreds of course variations that will keep your clicking finger busy for hours.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cheap Golf, a surreal, low-res physics playground built by an intrusive, passive-aggressive AI named Susan. She has spent her cybernetic life constructing the ultimate abstract minigolf gauntlet, and now she requires a human test subject. That’s you. Don't let her down (she gets emotional).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/b61cbec9f562afefb3b797edf060f2f7.poster.avif?t=1793040592\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/b61cbec9f562afefb3b797edf060f2f7.webm?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/b61cbec9f562afefb3b797edf060f2f7.mp4?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Input, Cosmic Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheap Golf strips the classic sport down to its absolute bare essentials, then injects it with psychedelic chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and Boop: Use a simple click-and-drag mechanic to launch your tiny digital ball (referred to as a &quot;boop&quot;) across mind-bending maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-School Nostalgia: Bask in a retro, minimalist aesthetic that looks like a glitching 1980s computer monitor having a beautiful fever dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Just One More Flail&quot; Loop: Experience high-speed, instant-respawn physics puzzles that reward experimentation, precision, and a high tolerance for Susan’s commentary.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/289b71200fccaa693174e6b2a2818263.poster.avif?t=1793040592\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/289b71200fccaa693174e6b2a2818263.webm?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/289b71200fccaa693174e6b2a2818263.mp4?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Susan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Susan, your omnipresent host, has been very busy attempting to keep you entertained. She didn't just build a course; she built an entire digital labyrinth designed to test the limits of your human patience and spatial awareness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >140 Levels of Madness: Journey through 3 massive episodes packed with bizarre hazards, shifting architecture, moving platforms, and literal ball-killers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Obstacles: Just when you think you’ve mastered the trajectory, the courses begin to morph, warp, and defy the traditional laws of geometry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Susan will cheer you on, judge your terrible angles, and question your species' intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/6293395ab33c7b73c037e650c5ddd736.poster.avif?t=1793040592\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/6293395ab33c7b73c037e650c5ddd736.webm?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/6293395ab33c7b73c037e650c5ddd736.mp4?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pure Retro Counter-Culture</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what golf wishes it could be if it stopped taking itself so seriously. Cheap Golf is a cozy, chaotic, and delightfully strange vacation for your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball is waiting. Susan is watching. Will you survive Cheap Golf?</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cheap Golf, a surreal, low-res physics playground built by an intrusive, passive-aggressive AI named Susan. She has spent her cybernetic life constructing the ultimate abstract minigolf gauntlet, and now she requires a human test subject. That’s you. Don't let her down (she gets emotional).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/b61cbec9f562afefb3b797edf060f2f7.poster.avif?t=1793040592\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/b61cbec9f562afefb3b797edf060f2f7.webm?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/b61cbec9f562afefb3b797edf060f2f7.mp4?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Input, Cosmic Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheap Golf strips the classic sport down to its absolute bare essentials, then injects it with psychedelic chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and Boop: Use a simple click-and-drag mechanic to launch your tiny digital ball (referred to as a &quot;boop&quot;) across mind-bending maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-School Nostalgia: Bask in a retro, minimalist aesthetic that looks like a glitching 1980s computer monitor having a beautiful fever dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Just One More Flail&quot; Loop: Experience high-speed, instant-respawn physics puzzles that reward experimentation, precision, and a high tolerance for Susan’s commentary.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/289b71200fccaa693174e6b2a2818263.poster.avif?t=1793040592\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/289b71200fccaa693174e6b2a2818263.webm?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/289b71200fccaa693174e6b2a2818263.mp4?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Susan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Susan, your omnipresent host, has been very busy attempting to keep you entertained. She didn't just build a course; she built an entire digital labyrinth designed to test the limits of your human patience and spatial awareness.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >140 Levels of Madness: Journey through 3 massive episodes packed with bizarre hazards, shifting architecture, moving platforms, and literal ball-killers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Obstacles: Just when you think you’ve mastered the trajectory, the courses begin to morph, warp, and defy the traditional laws of geometry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Susan will cheer you on, judge your terrible angles, and question your species' intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/6293395ab33c7b73c037e650c5ddd736.poster.avif?t=1793040592\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/6293395ab33c7b73c037e650c5ddd736.webm?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616520/extras/6293395ab33c7b73c037e650c5ddd736.mp4?t=1793040592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pure Retro Counter-Culture</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what golf wishes it could be if it stopped taking itself so seriously. Cheap Golf is a cozy, chaotic, and delightfully strange vacation for your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball is waiting. Susan is watching. Will you survive Cheap Golf?</p>",
